










In Nagar Panchayat, the head is President or Chairman, whereas the administrative head is Chief Municipal Officer. This is the same for Nagarpalika, the head being the President and the administrative officer is the Chief Municipal Officer. But for Municipal Corporation, which is the biggest body, the head is called the Mayor and the Chief Administrative Officer is the Municipal Commissioner.

The major works of Pandit Mukutdhar Pandey were Shailbala, Hridaya Daan, and Puja ke Phool.

In the scheme Pradhan Mantri Krishi Suraksha Yojana, 55% subsidy is given to the small marginal farmers and 45% to all other farmers. This scheme started on 1 July 2015 while the Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana started on 18 February 2016.

PM Kusum Yojana started in March 2019. Kisan Urja Suraksha evam Mahabhiyan is the full form of PM Kusum Yojana.

Khuti or Dhadha is worn in the ear in Chhattisgarh.

Things worn on the wrist are Patiya, Kakni, Haraiya, Bahuta, and Nagmori.

lurki is worn on the earlobe in Chhattisgarh. Ornaments worn on the ear in Chhattisgarh: Tittri, Lurki, Bari, Khuti, Dhadha, Eran, Karnaphool, Phundri.

Ornaments worn on the neck in Chhattisgarh: Sutiya, Sora, Hasli, Putli, Dholki, Tilak, Kantha.

Ornaments worn on the wrist or hand in Chhattisgarh: Patiya, Chudi, Kakni, Nagmori, Bahuta, Banrakhi.

Ornaments worn on the legs in Chhattisgarh: Paijana, Toda, Chhati, Bichhiya, Payal.

raksganda waterfall is on Rihand river in Surajpur district whereas Kendai waterfall is in Katghora tehsil of Korba district. Godana waterfall is in Gariaband district.
